  "invariants": {
    "status": "present",
    "value": [
      "Provide get, put and resize with least-recently-used eviction. get returns -1 for absence and otherwise refreshes recency. put refreshes existing keys. Nonnegative resize immediately evicts oldest entries until within capacity; zero capacity retains nothing.",
      "Observing a result must not change earlier returned snapshots or mutate input containers."
    ],
